Z||000000||rogergarrison||08-14-2001||04:44 PM||||I was just thinking that we might combine 2mdales bbq and the Mid Ohio Vintage race next june. They have primitive camping there and we could all get together and spend sat-sun there. They race all vintage sports cars all day both days. Plenty of shade, food, etc. Sunday there is a huge car show in the infield and we could have an area designated for Fieros and rebodies.The pits are also totally open to public so you can talk to owners/drivers and check out the racers closeup. They only give out 15 total trophies buts its a lot of fun. Everyone also gets a chance to run a couple of pace laps around the track on sunday at noon. Anyone game or interested?<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=9116379&p=34556781"> ||||reg||1
